From: obig20 <obig20@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:26:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] Add camera collision: ray-vs-box clipping keeps the
 camera out of platforms

New physics/raycast.ts (slab-method ray/box test plus clipRay). The follow camera
now pulls in instantly when a platform is in the way and eases back out.
Removes the 'camera does not collide' limitation. 12 new tests.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
